const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"研究问题",en:"Research question"},body:{zh:"论文研究交易商库存、报价修订与订单失衡所传递信息之间的动态关系。 阅读时先把它理解为一个被界定的问题，而不是可以脱离样本、时间和制度环境的结论。",en:"“An Analysis of Changes in Specialist Inventories and Quotations” frames a bounded research question. Read the stated question together with the named sample, dates, and institutional setting rather than treating it as a conclusion that automatically travels to another market or period."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1540-6261.1993.tb05122.x",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance (1993) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance (1993) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"研究设计",en:"Research design"},body:{zh:"来源以包含库存与信息效应的动态做市模型为起点，并用纽约证券交易所一名 specialist 的库存资料检验。 这说明比较对象、观察窗口和对照关系是研究合同的一部分；改变其中任何一项，都可能改变所检验的命题。",en:"For “An Analysis of Changes in Specialist Inventories and Quotations”, the source describes a deliberate comparison, observation window, and control relation. Those choices are part of its research contract: changing one can change the proposition being tested, even when the method label remains the same."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1540-6261.1993.tb05122.x",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance (1993) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance (1993) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"数据与时点",en:"Data and timing"},body:{zh:"关键输入包括交易商库存、交易、报价修订、订单失衡代理及它们一致的日内时间戳。 数据字段、可得时点和样本筛选需要与原始研究分开记录，不能仅凭同名变量或最终修订数据就视为可比。",en:"For “An Analysis of Changes in Specialist Inventories and Quotations”, keep the fields, their availability timing, and the sample filters separate from the original study. A same-named variable, later-revised database, or matching end-of-period date is not automatically a comparable input."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1540-6261.1993.tb05122.x",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance (1993) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance (1993) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"如何理解结果",en:"How to read the result"},body:{zh:"摘要讨论库存向目标水平回归，以及报价修订与交易和订单失衡信息之间的关系，并非所有电子市场的通用描述。 它支持的是该来源所描述的经验或理论关系；它本身不把相关性、模型拟合或历史表现升级为因果、可执行性或未来保证。",en:"For “An Analysis of Changes in Specialist Inventories and Quotations”, the source supports only the empirical or theoretical relation it describes. It does not turn association, model fit, or historical performance into causality, a directly executable procedure, or a guarantee about subsequent outcomes."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1540-6261.1993.tb05122.x",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance (1993) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance (1993) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"复核清单",en:"Replication checks"},body:{zh:"记录交易商角色和制度、库存数据可见范围、报价更新顺序及交易方向识别规则，避免把库存代理当作真实账户头寸。 在做后续分析前，应把这些选择写入版本化的研究记录，并保留原始来源链接与访问日期。",en:"Before extending “An Analysis of Changes in Specialist Inventories and Quotations”, record its sample, timing, construction choices, and source edition in a versioned note. Keep the primary-source link and access date so a later reader can distinguish a changed definition from a changed result."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1540-6261.1993.tb05122.x",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance (1993) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance (1993) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"适用边界",en:"Scope boundary"},body:{zh:"该条导读引用 The Journal of Finance (1993)。特定 specialist 制度和单一库存样本不能替代现代订单簿、参与者身份或其他市场的做市行为证据。 若需要量化结论、参数、表格或稳健性检验，请回到原文并单独核对版本、附录与样本定义。",en:"This guide cites The Journal of Finance (1993) for “An Analysis of Changes in Specialist Inventories and Quotations”. Its public description defines the boundary. For numerical conclusions, parameters, tables, or robustness tests, return to the original and separately verify the edition, appendices, and sample definitions."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1540-6261.1993.tb05122.x",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance (1993) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance (1993) · source description"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"本文只整理“An Analysis of Changes in Specialist Inventories and Quotations”所公开说明的研究问题与设计边界，不构成收益预测、交易规则或全文复现。特定 specialist 制度和单一库存样本不能替代现代订单簿、参与者身份或其他市场的做市行为证据。",en:"This guide only organizes the publicly described question and design of “An Analysis of Changes in Specialist Inventories and Quotations”. It is not a return forecast, trading rule, or full-text replication. The source's stated scope remains controlling."}};export{e as default};
